# The decoder binds dst to AH. Only five status bits enter the packed byte.
require_width 8
read_flag cf CF
read_flag pf PF
read_flag af AF
read_flag zf ZF
read_flag sf SF
zext c cf 8
zext p pf 8
zext a af 8
zext z zf 8
zext s sf 8
const two 8 2
const four 8 4
const six 8 6
const seven 8 7
shl pb p two
shl ab a four
shl zb z six
shl sb s seven
or cp c pb
or cpa cp ab
or cpaz cpa zb
or packed cpaz sb
or result packed two
write dst result
preserve_flags all
retire
